      "source": "Each delegate method includes a [`AVCaptureResolvedPhotoSettings`](avcaptureresolvedphotosettings.md) whose [`uniqueID`](avcapturephotosettings/uniqueid.md) property matches the [`uniqueID`](avcapturephotosettings/uniqueid.md) value of the [`AVCapturePhotoSettings`](avcapturephotosettings.md) object you used to request capture.",
